  "sn52.24:1.1": "panāham āvuso catunnaṃ sati- bhā- bahuāsavānaṃ khayā anāsavam cetovimuttim paññāvimuttim diṭṭheva dhamme sayam abhiññā sacchikatvā upasampajja viharāmī ti || || ",
  "sn52.24:1.2": "",
  "sn52.24:1.3": "Sahassa ",
  "sn52.24:2.0": "",
  "sn52.24:2.1": "ca Iddhi atha ca ",
  "sn52.24:2.2": "pana || Cetoparicca Ṭhānam etī ti || ",
  "sn52.24:2.3": "Paṭidoliko Nānāvimutti || ",
  "sn52.24:2.4": "Indriyam Jānan tisso Vijjā ti || || ",
  "sn52.24:2.5": "Anuruddhasaṃyuttam aṭṭhamam || || 1--2. Sāvatthi || "
